      "status": "published",
      "format": "mdx",
      "body": "# Building a garden\r\n\r\nA digital garden is a place for work that changes. Published pages can be revised, linked and allowed to mature.\r\n\r\n![A simple leaf illustration](/garden-assets/leaf.svg)\r\n\r\nThis example lives in `examples/content/published/posts`. Drafts and private notes are staged by the publication gate only when their status and directory both allow it.",
